// Domain mapping on a single site. WP Landing Kit keeps each mapped domain
// as a `mapped-domain` post (title = the domain, published = active) whose
// content is JSON: its first mapping is what the domain shows (a page, post,
// product, term or post type archive, or a redirect), the last is the
// fallback, and any between are extra URLs. Read from the tables, so it
// works with plugin code skipped.
